33", "author": {"steamid": "76561198390024061", "personaname": "苏打汽水", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sunjingyi950412/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2841, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 433, "last_played": 1777284267, "avatar": "4efe1e4699f427f3dac9a9bf9d66c9968d91db66"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我觉得好玩  虽然感觉没有求生之路僵尸爆开那么解压 但是也该知足了  毕竟现在审核员是个死了妈的东西", "timestamp_created": 1646745470, "timestamp_updated": 1646745470, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472440958023071289", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111797234", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107154315", "personaname": "ShKua1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107154315/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1842, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 757, "last_played": 1681142878, "avatar": "d72c8ef0f183faf564b9407572d51751794acd15"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "垃圾。", "timestamp_created": 1646737309, "timestamp_updated": 1646737309, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541666686534881592", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111789938", "author": {"steamid": "76561199214827697", "personaname": "Face to face and eye to eye", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199214827697/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 265970, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2063, "playtime_at_review": 50642, "last_played": 1787897916, "avatar": "4113621e229b9cedd734f2085cea25c1dc3017fd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "坦白来说，这个模式节奏快，玩法缝合的也颇为有趣，虽然没什么新东西，但是的确好玩，很适合战役打腻了来试试手。此外，无论是战役还是虫群，在等待匹配的过程中，如果时间太长，玩家还可以到营地外的练枪场和队友来一场皇城pk，也可以在拳击台化身劲夫，打发无聊的时间，可以说做的颇为用心。特别是独特的卡牌系统，通过牌组的组合可以尝试到不同玩法，确实很不错。唯一不好的就是地图太少，要是能多设计一些地图，包括新的难度新的内容就更好了。个人还是很喜欢这款游戏，并且会永远支持。\n", "timestamp_created": 1646724660, "timestamp_updated": 1646724660, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}